  adversarial config) gets `opts.extraArgs`, i.e. the resolved
  `implement.extraArgs`. The adversarial reviewer role in the
  review pass gets none yet: US-007 should set it from
  `adv.review.extraArgs` (AdversarialOpts.review's type has no
  extraArgs field yet), alongside the orchestrator review spawns.
- review.ts still imports no values from orchestrator.
- Test (integration.test.ts): fake claude delegating to
